5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current system is failing. We need to define the scope of work before assigning it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I feel like the load is uneven. Some of us are here more than others.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about the social friction this is causing. We need a sustainable solution.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I just want to know who is paying for the supplies. It’s always my wallet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want the rooms to be predictable. I don't like the surprises.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, how do you propose we measure ""uneven""? We need data, not feelings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, it’s obvious. Look at the calendar. Some people are gone for weeks.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, the cost is a symptom. The root is the lack of clear responsibility.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, but if we don't track the money, the resentment stays. I need numbers.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with Rin. If we know the cost, maybe we can stop guessing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the time it actually takes to clean. We are underestimating it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the absences on the wall calendar. We need to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will read the note left by the previous tenants. Their failure is a warning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the receipts in the tin. I need to see the monthly drain.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at what each housemate counts as done. The standards are all over the place.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also time a full pass with a stopwatch. Precision is key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will also watch the kitchen use for a fortnight. Who is making the mess?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also review the rows recorded in the house chat. I want to see the triggers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will also check the bathroom spray stock. It seems we are buying duplicates.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check the bathroom grout after the July scrub. I need to know the decay rate.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
