35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The timing data is shocking. A full pass takes over an hour. The outside firm requires prep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,The calendar shows two of us are away most months. The kitchen mess comes from three people.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The previous tenants divided rooms permanently and stopped speaking. The chat logs show reminders cause fights.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The receipts show 2,300 yen a month in waste. The management office charges 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The definition of ""done"" varies wildly. The grout gets dirty again in eleven days. It’s hopeless.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, 4,200 yen an hour is expensive. But if it takes us 100 minutes, it’s 7,000 yen in lost time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we pay a pro, the ""away"" people still pay. Is that fair?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, fairness is secondary to peace. The previous tenants' silence is what I fear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, but if we pay, I need to know who settles the invoice. The management office bills one person.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I think... if we pay, we don't have to argue about what ""done"" means.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The firm's terms say they work around mess. We still have to tidy up. It’s not a magic fix.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,But it removes the daily friction. I don't want to be the one checking the grout.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,It removes the need for me to be the one reminding you. That is worth the cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I can handle the billing if we split it evenly. I just want the receipts to stop piling up.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am okay with paying. I just want the bathroom to stay clean for more than a week.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards the paid service. It standardizes the output.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I agree. It solves the absence problem.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I support it. It protects our relationships.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I support it, provided we automate the payment split.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I support it. Please.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
