60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is too risky. Option B is too rigid. Option C is the only one that scales.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option C handles the absences. Option B would just shift the blame to the present people.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option A led to silence before. Option C keeps the interaction minimal and professional.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option C lets me track the cost easily. Option B means I’m always chasing people for supplies.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option C means I don't have to guess. I just have to be there when they come.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The cost is high, but the time saved is significant. I vote C.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,The fairness of the split is manageable. I vote C.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,The social capital saved is worth the yen. I vote C.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,The financial clarity is what I need. I vote C.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,The predictability is what I need. I vote C.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,Is there any objection to the billing method?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,"No, as long as it’s automatic.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,No.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I will set up the transfer.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let’s finalize this.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
